
>> Animal := Objekt nĳ.
Animal by: ['nĳ'] dwaan: { <- sels nĳ init.
}.

Animal by: ['init'] dwaan: {
	eigen sound := ['?'].
	eigen legs := 4.
}.

>> Dog := Animal nĳ.
Dog by: ['init'] dwaan: {
	sels init.
	eigen sound := ['barks'].
}.

Animal by: ['tekst'] dwaan: { <- eigen legs tekst + eigen sound.
}.

>> poodle := Dog nĳ.
Utfier skriuwe: poodle, nije-rigel.

